@crew v-gunn-kaito
// Writer 4, batch 5: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Morning. Dr. Kaito Gunn, relief. Eleven ships. Your galley's top three already.
- Hello. Covering the infirmary for a week. Drink some water, by the way.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. Brennan's soup today: nine. Don't tell the other ten ships.   #funny
?

== chat
- I remember every galley I've worked near. Food's how you know a ship.
- Up early, shopping early. I always bring something on for the next ship.

== near
? time:morning
- Early start. Good toast. Eight and a half.   #funny
? place:crew_store
- Your store has good biscuits. Some are coming with me to ship twelve.
?

== bye
- {bye}. Eat properly. Doctor's orders.

== smalltalk
- Soup. Nine.   #funny
- Water. Drink it. Doctor says.
